        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkiterunoto e utunoto",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulo ninche irorei apa ooirorie Musa iltung'ana le Israel pooki te lido kekun lo lkeju le Yordan ti ong'ata, te Araba te nkipirakinoto e Sufu, te rishata e Paran o Tofel, o Laban, o Heserot o Disahab. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkolong'i tomon oobo elototo ebaiki Horeb te nkoitoi o ldoinyo le Seir o metabaiki Kadesh-Barnea, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore to lari le artam, te nkolong e dukuya olapa le tomon oobo, neirorie Musa iltung'ana le Israel te risioroto e nena pooki naaishoo ninye Olaitoriani aitanap ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.2.21+NUM.2.22+NUM.2.23+NUM.2.24+NUM.2.25+NUM.2.26+NUM.2.27+NUM.2.28+NUM.2.29+NUM.2.30+NUM.2.31+NUM.2.32+NUM.2.33+NUM.2.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enki 2.21-34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ina kata eidipa ninye atimira Sihon olaiguanani loo Lamori apa omanya Heshbon o Oog olaiguanani le Bashan apa omanya Ashtarot o Edrei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te lido kekun lo lkeju le Yordan, te nkop e Moab, neinosu Musa ena kitanapata, ejo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Etiaaka apa iyiook Olaitoriani Enkai ang te Horeb, ‘Itobiko intae oleng tele doinyo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "embelekenyunye enteru elototo inyi, nipuopuo ina kop oo ldoinyo e Amori, ole latia enye pooki te Araba, teina kop oo ldoinyo o te nkop nashong'ishong, o Negeb, o lomanaa le naiposha, ina kop ooLkanaan, o Lebanon o metabaiki ilo keju kitok, ilo keju le Frati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ura airragie nanu enkop te dukuya intae. Enchom intae ewaita ina kop apa nainosie Olaitoriani olmumai too loo papaai linyi te Abraham, te Isaak o te Yakobo, pee eisho ninche o eishoi enye tesiadi ninche.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Etegelua Musa Larishak",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore apa teina kata atiaaka intae, ‘Maidim nanu openy atanapa intae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "etopona intae Olaitoriani Enkai inyi, naa ng'ura, ibaba intae ena olong anaa ilakir le shumata te nkumoi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meitaa intae Olaitoriani Enkai oo loo papaai linyi katitin enkalifu te nkumoi alang enibaba. Nemayian intae, anaa enaisiligie intae! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaji nanu aiko openy te nanap enkiroishi o lola linyi, o loo larrabali linyi?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Entegelu iltung'ana ng'eni, oodamisho neeta eyiolounoto, te risioroto oo loshon linyi, pee agelu nanu ninche metaa ilaitasheikinok linyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikitawalikitia intae, aajo, ‘Ore ina bae nitejo naa eisidai te nikiaas iyiook.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku aawa apa nanu lelo arikok loo loshon linyi, lelo tung'ana ng'eni arriyiak, naitaa ninche ilarikok linyi, ilaitasheikinok loo nkalifuni o ilaitasheikinok loo maa iip, o ilaitasheikinok loo maa-onom, o laitasheikinok loo maa tomon ilkituaak tiatua iloshon linyi pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naitanap apa nanu ilarishak linyi te ina kata, ajoki ‘Entoning nkiguanat oo lalashera linyi entirish ninche, nidung'udung'u enkiguana te sipata te rishata o ltung'ani o lalashe lenye, aashu ilo likae otii te nebo ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimiatata olkep te ndung'okinoto e nkiguana; entoning oltung'ani oti o lkitok, tenkitorisiokinoto; miureyu enkomom o ltung'ani amu ore endung'okinoto enkiguana naa ene Nkai, ore ilo rorei ogol te iyie niyau enatii nanu, naa kaning nanu,’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naitanapa apa nanu intae teina kata nena tokitin pooki naaishiakino niasiasa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eirriwayioki ilaikitalak te Kadesh-Barnea",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kitudumunye apa iyiook te Horeb, nikipuo aaim ina ong'ata sapuk nagol nitoduaa, kiimita ina oitoi eina kop oo ldoinyo nalo Amori, anaa enaitanapa iyiook Olaitoriani Enkai ang; nikipuonu Kadesh-Barnea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naitoki nanu ajoki intae, ‘Itabautua intae enkop oo ldoinyo e Amori, apa naishoo iyiook Olaitoriani Enkai ang. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ura eirragie Olaitoriani Enkai inyi ena kop te dukuya intae; elepa enchom, ewaita anaa apa enatiaka intae Olaitoriani Enkai oo loo papaai linyi; miureishoyuyu niming'aing'aiyiayia.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikipuonunu intae pooki aanyikaki nanu, nijojo, ‘Emairriwai iltung'ana meituruko te iyiook aajur enkop, neyaki iyiook olomoni le nkoitoi nikiim o nena anas nikipuo.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etalie apa ina bae aa sidai te nanu, nagelu nanu iltung'ana tomon oare te intae, oltung'ani obo ake to losho; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neibelekenya ninche neilep aapuo ina kop oo ndoinyo, nebau oerata le Eshkol neikitalan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyau ninche too nkaik enye embata oo lng'anayio leina kop neitadou aayaki iyiook, neitoki aayaki iyiook olkilikuai, nejo, ‘Enkop sidai ina naishoo iyiook Olaitoriani Enkai ang.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
